{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall combines\u00a0<strong>PvP Survival Crafting</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Extraction Shooters</strong>, inspired by games like Rust and Helldivers 2. Enginefall is a\u00a0<strong>chaotic social shooter</strong>, with\u00a0<strong>high-intensity play</strong>\u00a0that fits your schedule, and\u00a0<strong>deep progression</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/8fdd9bdc27a8fb90c73190eac9ecf21f.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/8fdd9bdc27a8fb90c73190eac9ecf21f.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall is set in a ravaged world where the rail network is humanity\u2019s last refuge. While most live onboard colossal <strong>Titan trains</strong>, some bold survivors have escaped to become <strong>Freerailers</strong>: nomads who roam from train to train on a constant hunt for resources and a place to call home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/15d10160c8d0381d91f8e88ab69150bc.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/15d10160c8d0381d91f8e88ab69150bc.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Freerailer, you live onboard your <strong>Dagger shuttle</strong>, a homebase on wheels in the form of a repurposed service train. From there, <strong>you and up to 4 friends</strong> will raid resource rich Titan trains in search of critical fuel and other valuables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/77400dde7dac6fb3f0fe1d165a62d89c.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/77400dde7dac6fb3f0fe1d165a62d89c.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, steal, and scheme your way from the back of the train to the engine using your limited pool of lives to outwit <strong>up to 85 other Freerailers</strong>, claim the all-important <strong>fuel cores</strong>, and make your escape back to your Dagger shuttle. Use your hard earned fuel cores to <strong>power and upgrade your dagger,</strong> as well as research valuable technology to help you in future raids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/40db151d3112cc4d68485ad5f49b0e13.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/40db151d3112cc4d68485ad5f49b0e13.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time is right, pool your efforts with your friends to get your hands on your own private <strong>Marauder train</strong>. Build it up from a single carriage to rival the scale of the Titans. Keep your Marauder train fueled by raiding Titan trains, or <strong>attack rival Marauder trains in epic cross-server assaults</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/cd4e20f33cd0ac931cc1a35ae178ecbc.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/cd4e20f33cd0ac931cc1a35ae178ecbc.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit</strong> more Freerailers to your Marauder train as passengers, and vie for <strong>dominance of the tracks</strong>. But beware, if a Marauder conductor doesn\u2019t keep their passengers happy, an <strong>internal uprising</strong> can be just as dangerous as a rival train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marauder Trains should be available for playtesting and feedback in <strong>early 2026</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/10ed481ef08c92f4553cbe7377badfb4.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/10ed481ef08c92f4553cbe7377badfb4.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall is still in <strong>early development</strong> and we need your feedback to make Enginefall the kind of game you want to play! To stay up to date with all the latest news and playtests, make sure to <strong>Wishlist and Follow Enginefall on Steam</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2437390?t=1764155604","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764155604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/8b817e607751ac60e577e00bb13c78221fced31b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764155604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/8b817e607751ac60e577e00bb13c78221fced31b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764155604","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains violent content with the presence of blood, as well as voice chat support."},"detailed_description":"<h1>CLOSED PLAYTEST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/4061a3ef50aa9fc0175a5518227a2b73.avif?t=1764155604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras_big/4061a3ef50aa9fc0175a5518227a2b73.avif?t=1764155604 width=1560 height=482 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall combines\u00a0<strong>PvP Survival Crafting</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Extraction Shooters</strong>, inspired by games like Rust and Helldivers 2. Enginefall is a\u00a0<strong>chaotic social shooter</strong>, with\u00a0<strong>high-intensity play</strong>\u00a0that fits your schedule, and\u00a0<strong>deep progression</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/8fdd9bdc27a8fb90c73190eac9ecf21f.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/8fdd9bdc27a8fb90c73190eac9ecf21f.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall is set in a ravaged world where the rail network is humanity\u2019s last refuge. While most live onboard colossal <strong>Titan trains</strong>, some bold survivors have escaped to become <strong>Freerailers</strong>: nomads who roam from train to train on a constant hunt for resources and a place to call home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/15d10160c8d0381d91f8e88ab69150bc.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/15d10160c8d0381d91f8e88ab69150bc.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Freerailer, you live onboard your <strong>Dagger shuttle</strong>, a homebase on wheels in the form of a repurposed service train. From there, <strong>you and up to 4 friends</strong> will raid resource rich Titan trains in search of critical fuel and other valuables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/77400dde7dac6fb3f0fe1d165a62d89c.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/77400dde7dac6fb3f0fe1d165a62d89c.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, steal, and scheme your way from the back of the train to the engine using your limited pool of lives to outwit <strong>up to 85 other Freerailers</strong>, claim the all-important <strong>fuel cores</strong>, and make your escape back to your Dagger shuttle. Use your hard earned fuel cores to <strong>power and upgrade your dagger,</strong> as well as research valuable technology to help you in future raids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/40db151d3112cc4d68485ad5f49b0e13.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/40db151d3112cc4d68485ad5f49b0e13.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time is right, pool your efforts with your friends to get your hands on your own private <strong>Marauder train</strong>. Build it up from a single carriage to rival the scale of the Titans. Keep your Marauder train fueled by raiding Titan trains, or <strong>attack rival Marauder trains in epic cross-server assaults</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/cd4e20f33cd0ac931cc1a35ae178ecbc.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/cd4e20f33cd0ac931cc1a35ae178ecbc.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit</strong> more Freerailers to your Marauder train as passengers, and vie for <strong>dominance of the tracks</strong>. But beware, if a Marauder conductor doesn\u2019t keep their passengers happy, an <strong>internal uprising</strong> can be just as dangerous as a rival train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marauder Trains should be available for playtesting and feedback in <strong>early 2026</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/10ed481ef08c92f4553cbe7377badfb4.poster.avif?t=1764155604\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/10ed481ef08c92f4553cbe7377badfb4.webm?t=1764155604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall is still in <strong>early development</strong> and we need your feedback to make Enginefall the kind of game you want to play! To stay up to date with all the latest news and playtests, make sure to <strong>Wishlist and Follow Enginefall on Steam</strong>!</p>","developers":["Red Rover Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/aef471f942db87138e892f87cfb51ce446003cd1/header.jpg?t=1764155604","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>Video features 'Future Earth' font</strong> Dafont, licensed CC BY-ND","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2437390/364453425/4e3e90b0e3dc7af2b7b75552c7e5f30d18393ae5/1761246403/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761756901","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2437390/364453425/4e3e90b0e3dc7af2b7b75552c7e5f30d18393ae5/1761246403/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761756901","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/24